Wine expand.exe: accept /R and /F:<filespec> anywhere on the command line, and extract a cabinet into a folder (the destination, or the source's folder) under the names it stores, keeping only the files that match the filespec. LuminaXP for X-Plane 12 unpacks its DLSS 5 model with expand.exe -R -F:nvngx_dlssnr.dll <cabinet> <folder>; Wine read "-R" as the input file and exited with 1.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

